// On one enemy: the curse's marker clock (the spell lock itself is DnD_SilenceTimer, from SilenceMonster).
Actor DnD_SilenceCursed : DnD_Info {}
Actor DnD_SilenceCursedTimer : DnD_Info {}

// The curse marker over a silenced enemy: frame J of the curse row (FlammabilityFXMarker).
Actor SilenceFXMarker : FlammabilityFXMarker {
	States {
		SpawnLoop:
			CM1O J 0
		Goto CurseJoin
	}
}

// The ring drawn where the curse lands, from rank 10, in pale grey sparks.
Actor SilenceAreaMarkerFX : NoxAreaMarkerFX {
	Translation "80:111=%[0.00,0.00,0.00]:[1.30,1.30,1.45]"
}
